03:45.040 --> 03:47.790
<b>Following the wind, 
 following their whims...</b>

03:48.370 --> 03:51.000
<b>...in a forest somewhere, 
 in a region somewhere...</b>

03:51.540 --> 03:55.300
<b>...Satoshi and Pikachu’s 
 directionless journey continues.</b>

03:55.840 --> 03:59.640
<b>Now then, what Pokémon 
 will they meet today?</b>

04:04.970 --> 04:06.890
<b>Pi! Ka! Chu!</b>

04:06.890 --> 04:08.190
<b>Pi!</b>

04:08.190 --> 04:09.690
<b>Ooh, a Mukkuru!</b>

04:28.040 --> 04:30.540
<b>Huh?! Koiking?!</b>

04:35.840 --> 04:38.550
<b>Pikachu! 
 Don’t just laugh at me...</b>

04:49.100 --> 04:50.770
<b>Thanks...</b>

04:59.700 --> 05:00.740
<b>A Cocoon?</b>

05:05.080 --> 05:08.160
<b>Oww...</b>

05:16.590 --> 05:17.960
<b>Is it sleeping?</b>

05:24.640 --> 05:27.180
<b>What?! Now?!</b>

05:34.810 --> 05:36.730
<b>It evolved...</b>

05:59.670 --> 06:00.510
<b>Poke.</b>

06:12.520 --> 06:15.100
<b>That was scary...</b>

06:15.100 --> 06:16.060
<b>But...</b>

06:17.480 --> 06:19.030
<b>Did you see that, Pikachu?!</b>

06:19.030 --> 06:20.110
<b>I...</b>

06:20.820 --> 06:23.780
<b>...may have just 
 made friends with that Spear!</b>

07:04.990 --> 07:06.700
<b>Ms. Mom!</b>

07:06.700 --> 07:08.370
<b>Hello!</b>

07:08.370 --> 07:09.830
<b>Professor Okido!</b>

07:09.830 --> 07:11.450
<b>How are you doing?</b>

07:11.450 --> 07:13.700
<b>Have you heard from Satoshi?</b>

07:13.700 --> 07:15.790
<b>Nope, not a word since.</b>

07:15.790 --> 07:18.710
<b>I don’t know where he is 
 or what he’s up to.</b>

07:18.710 --> 07:22.960
<b>Well, it’s nice to wander around 
 without any particular goal every now and then.</b>

07:22.960 --> 07:25.970
<b>I used to be just like that 
 when I was young.</b>

07:25.970 --> 07:28.970
<b>Oh, he does have a goal of sorts.</b>

07:28.970 --> 07:31.600
<b>He said he wanted 
 to make more friends.{echoes OP / ED lines}</b>

07:31.600 --> 07:33.350
<b>Hmm, friends...</b>

07:33.350 --> 07:35.310
<b>A poem just came to mind.</b>

07:35.310 --> 07:46.570
<b>Pokémon Haiku</b>

07:35.850 --> 07:40.360
<b>If it’s friends you seek 
 You should start with Pokémon 
 Hundred fifty one</b>

07:40.360 --> 07:41.820
<b>Master of the craft!{Yoh, meijin seems to derive from 'iyoh, daitouryou', "芸をほめる呼びかけ" a call praising a work of art}</b>

07:56.120 --> 07:58.420
<b>Ooh, a Korobohshi!</b>

07:59.580 --> 08:01.210
<b>A Minezumi?</b>

08:03.380 --> 08:04.710
<b>Digda.</b>

08:07.260 --> 08:08.220
<b>Nyarth...</b>

08:13.470 --> 08:14.470
<b>Nyarth?!</b>

08:17.020 --> 08:17.770
<b>Pikachu!</b>

08:18.810 --> 08:20.190
<b>Byesy-meow!</b>

08:20.190 --> 08:21.310
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

08:22.650 --> 08:24.480
<b>If you ask us 
 “What are you doing?!”...</b>

08:24.940 --> 08:27.110
<b>We’ll answer out of 
 sympathy for the world!</b>

08:27.110 --> 08:29.610
<b>Whoosh! Shing!</b>

08:29.610 --> 08:32.120
<b>To protect the world from devastation.</b>

08:32.120 --> 08:35.370
<b>To preserve world peace.</b>

08:35.370 --> 08:38.250
<b>Championing the evils 
 of truth and love.</b>

08:38.250 --> 08:41.000
<b>We’re the lovely, charming villains.</b>

08:41.000 --> 08:42.250
<b>Musashi!</b>

08:42.250 --> 08:43.250
<b>Kojiro!</b>

08:45.380 --> 08:48.510
<b>The Team Rocket duo 
 soars through the galaxy!</b>

08:48.510 --> 08:52.090
<b>Like a white hole, 
 a white tomorrow awaits us!</b>

08:52.090 --> 08:54.180
<b>Just kidding, meow!</b>

08:58.390 --> 09:00.440
<b>You again, Team Rocket?!</b>

09:00.440 --> 09:03.690
<b>Wherever Pikachu may be, 
 Team Rocket is bound to follow, meow!{Proverb based on '人間到る処青山あり' ningen itaru tokoro seizan ari, ~'home is wherever one lays one's hat', lit. "Wherever humans die, there will be graves"}</b>

09:03.690 --> 09:06.280
<b>Then, Pikachu, 
 use 100,000 Volts!</b>

09:12.780 --> 09:13.950
<b>What?!</b>

09:14.910 --> 09:17.290
<b>This can absorb 
 all its electricity, meow!</b>

09:17.290 --> 09:19.540
<b>Then... Iron Tail!</b>

09:24.540 --> 09:26.300
<b>Escape is impossible!</b>

09:26.300 --> 09:29.470
<b>We exhaustively researched Pikachu...</b>

09:29.470 --> 09:33.050
<b>...and made an invention 
 that can withstand not just Iron Tail,</b>

09:33.050 --> 09:37.260
<b>but any impact whatsoever; 
 the Super DX Capture Net!</b>

09:37.260 --> 09:39.140
<b>So! With that outta the way...</b>

09:39.140 --> 09:40.520
<b><i>We’ll be off!</i></b>

09:40.520 --> 09:41.890
<b>You think I’ll let you?</b>

09:41.890 --> 09:42.690
<b>Go, Onvern!{Since Go has left the program, Satoshi’s “Say ‘go’ to his Pokémon” privileges have been restored.}</b>

09:47.900 --> 09:49.280
<b>Blast Waves!</b>

09:51.030 --> 09:52.700
<b>Sonansu, take care of it.</b>

09:56.910 --> 09:58.910
<b>It’s up to you, Donphan!</b>

10:06.920 --> 10:09.170
<b><i>Is that allowed?!</i></b>

10:09.170 --> 10:10.550
<b>And that’s not all.</b>

10:10.550 --> 10:12.170
<b>Go, Jukain!</b>

10:13.720 --> 10:14.680
<b>Leaf Blade!</b>

10:25.230 --> 10:26.690
<b>100,000 Volts!</b>

10:45.460 --> 10:47.380
<b>Thanks, everyone!</b>

10:48.210 --> 10:49.800
<b>You okay, Pikachu?</b>

10:51.210 --> 10:55.090
<b>I don’t get it. 
 Our Pikachu countermeasures were perfect.</b>

10:55.090 --> 10:58.970
<b>Alas, we didn’t prepare anything 
 for his other Pokémon...</b>

11:00.850 --> 11:02.980
<b>Now we’ll know for next time, meow—</b>

