<b>Hide!</b>

13:42.050 --> 13:43.180
<b><i>Vwoosh!</i></b>

13:45.890 --> 13:47.890
<b>The brat boy!</b>

13:58.570 --> 13:59.900
<b>Hold it, what’s that?</b>

14:00.820 --> 14:03.530
<b>Hey Rotom! 
 Who’s that Pokémon?</b>

14:03.530 --> 14:04.780
<b>Huh?</b>

14:06.990 --> 14:11.330
<b>Latias. Boundless Pokémon. 
 Dragon/Psychic type.</b>

14:11.330 --> 14:13.710
<b>It communicates 
 using telepathy.</b>

14:13.710 --> 14:18.300
<b>Its body is covered in down 
 that refracts light to make it invisible. {HGSS dex entry}</b>

14:18.300 --> 14:21.670
<b>In short, it’s a Legendary Pokémon. 
 Get it now?</b>

14:21.670 --> 14:22.970
<b>A Legendary Pokémon?!</b>

14:22.970 --> 14:24.130
<b>That’s a huge find!</b>

14:24.130 --> 14:26.550
<b>We’re gonna catch it, meow!</b>

14:33.980 --> 14:36.270
<b>Oh, they got untied.</b>

14:36.270 --> 14:37.820
<b>Thank you, Pikachu.</b>

14:39.270 --> 14:41.400
<b>We should spray 
 some more medicine, too.</b>

14:43.400 --> 14:44.700
<b>Thanks.</b>

14:45.450 --> 14:47.120
<b>This’ll sting a bit...</b>

14:48.200 --> 14:50.080
<b>Aww, sorry about that.</b>

14:53.460 --> 14:55.540
<b>This time 
 I’ll tie them tighter...</b>

14:56.330 --> 14:58.290
<b>...so they stay on.</b>

15:12.520 --> 15:14.350
<b>That should do it.</b>

15:15.440 --> 15:17.900
<b>I hope you get better soon, Latias.</b>

15:18.860 --> 15:20.900
<b>Just rest up for now.</b>

15:58.440 --> 16:00.940
<b>Latias! Good morning!</b>

16:06.070 --> 16:07.400
<b>You can’t do that yet!</b>

16:11.160 --> 16:12.450
<b>She’s scared...</b>

16:14.870 --> 16:18.830
<b>I don’t know what happened, 
 but we’re helping you!</b>

16:20.670 --> 16:22.500
<b>We’re all worried about you!</b>

16:23.340 --> 16:25.510
<b>See? Come back down!</b>

16:27.300 --> 16:29.550
<b>Can you understand me?</b>

16:32.350 --> 16:34.220
<b>H-Hey, are you okay, Latias?!</b>

16:41.100 --> 16:42.690
<b>Latias!</b>

16:59.960 --> 17:01.710
<b>Open sesame!</b>

17:01.710 --> 17:03.210
<b>Click, meow!</b>

17:04.460 --> 17:06.840
<b>We caught Latias!</b>

17:13.850 --> 17:16.470
<b>What? 
 I heard something, meow.</b>

17:16.890 --> 17:18.270
<b>So cold!</b>

17:18.270 --> 17:19.730
<b>Ack! The brat boy!</b>

17:19.730 --> 17:22.730
<b>Oh, geez! It came with 
 some worthless freebie!</b>

17:25.980 --> 17:26.730
<b>Hold on, meow.</b>

17:27.150 --> 17:30.860
<b>If the brat boy’s up here, 
 those guys can’t attack us, meow.</b>

17:30.860 --> 17:34.320
<b>Oh! Of course! 
 He can be our hostage!</b>

17:34.320 --> 17:36.910
<b>Taking hostages 
 is elementary villainy!</b>

17:41.750 --> 17:44.210
<b>Hey! Don’t you move, Pikachu!</b>

17:44.210 --> 17:46.750
<b>Don’t you care 
 what could happen to the brat boy?</b>

17:48.630 --> 17:52.260
<b>K-Kids don’t get cold! 
 I can deal with this just fine!</b>

17:54.930 --> 17:57.470
<b>Latias, you okay?</b>

17:57.470 --> 18:00.270
<b>Just hold on, 
 I’ll get you out somehow.</b>

18:01.390 --> 18:03.520
<b>Escape is impossible!</b>

18:03.520 --> 18:06.480
<b>This time, 
