18:06.480 --> 18:10.400
<b>and now the Ice-hating Dragon type faces 
 Operation: Supercooled Capsule!</b>

18:10.400 --> 18:12.490
<b>It’s super effective!</b>

18:14.030 --> 18:15.660
<b>Operation successful!</b>

18:15.660 --> 18:18.040
<b>What a great feeling!</b>

18:22.290 --> 18:24.250
<b>Can’t I do anything...?</b>

