23:41.360 --> 23:44.820
<b>Following an order 
 to catch new Pokémon...</b>

23:44.820 --> 23:47.700
<b>...we made our first visit 
 to the Paldea Region.</b>

23:47.700 --> 23:50.030
<b>Oh, meow? 
 There’s one, meow!</b>

23:50.030 --> 23:53.540
<b>Hmm... It’s not in here.</b>

23:54.120 --> 23:56.000
<b>Huh? What’s that?</b>

23:56.330 --> 23:57.210
<b>Let’s open it up!</b>

23:58.670 --> 23:59.830
<b>Bingo, meow!</b>

23:59.830 --> 24:02.500
<b>The Legendary Pokémon, 
 Koraidon.</b>

24:02.500 --> 24:06.800
<b>It is said to have power 
 far surpassing that of other Pokémon,</b>

24:06.800 --> 24:09.090
<b>but its biology 
 is shrouded in mystery.{Website description, reworded}</b>

24:09.090 --> 24:11.680
<b>All right, let’s catch it quick!</b>

24:11.680 --> 24:12.180
<b>Yeah!</b>

24:17.810 --> 24:20.480
<b>What an awful feeling!</b>

24:24.570 --> 24:25.820
<b>Today’s roundup...</b>

24:25.820 --> 24:27.030
<b>Koraidon is a...</b>

24:27.030 --> 24:28.280
<b>Ko-fright-don!</b>

24:28.280 --> 24:30.370
<b></b>Ko-fright-don
